|               |       AggregateExec: mode=SinglePartitioned, gby=[l_orderkey@2 as l_orderkey, o_orderdate@0 as o_orderdate, o_shippriority@1 as o_shippriority], aggr=[sum(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, on=[(o_orderkey@0, l_orderkey@0)], projection=[o_orderdate@1, o_shippriority@2, l_orderkey@3, l_extendedprice@4, l_discount@5]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
